rom receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n','Hearing','Sh. Jagdish Singh Khushdil, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'memberjsk','2018-12-17 12:22:17.000','memberjsk','2018-12-17 12:22:17.000'),(72,1068,1061,'AdCNo10352018','FormTypeM','2019-01-16 00:00:00.000','9:30 AM','2202','2102','Notice for Appearance/Reply','','','Hearing','Sh. Jagdish Singh Khushdil, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'memberjsk','2018-12-17 12:23:16.000','memberjsk','2018-12-17 12:23:16.000'),(73,1069,1026,'AdCNo10092018','FormTypeM','2018-12-20 00:00:00.000','9:30 AM','2202','2103','Consideration','','Matter adjourned to 20.12.2018','Hearing','Sh. Jagdish Singh Khushdil, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',1,0,0,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-19 10:25:36.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-19 10:25:36.000'),(74,1070,1022,'AdCNo10102018','FormTypeM','2019-01-08 00:00:00.000','9:30 AM','2202','2103','Consideration','','Matter adjourned to 08.01.2019 for further proceedings.','Hearing','Sh. Jagdish Singh Khushdil, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-20 10:06:28.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-20 10:06:28.000'),(75,1071,1079,'AdCNo10472018','FormTypeM','2019-01-24 00:00:00.000','9:30 AM','2202','2102','Notice for Appearance/Reply','','','Hearing','Sh. Jagdish Singh Khushdil, Adjud