dress, if any and if e-mail address is not available or due to any reason if it is not possible, then to send notice to the complainant through registered/speed post with a direction to the complainant to file a similar set of complaint as well as documents submitted online. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. A report be also obtained from the registration branch  of the Authority whether the project is registered one or unregistered. The file shall be taken up at 930AM on that date.\r\n(J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer, \r\nRERA 04.10.2019\r\n','Hearing','Sh. Jagdish Singh Khushdil, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:27:50.000','psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:27:50.000'),(921,1886,1489,'AdCNo13592019','FormTypeM','2019-11-06 00:00:00.000','9:30 AM','2202','2102','Notice for Appearance/Reply','','','Hearing','Sh. Jagdish Singh Khushdil, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:30:57.000','psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:30:57.000'),(922,1887,1483,'AdCNo13542019UR','FormTypeM','2019-11-06 00:00:00.000','9:30 AM','2202','2102','Notice for Appearance/Reply','','','Hearing','Sh. Jagdish Singh Khushdil, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:32:46.000','psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:32:46.000'),(923,1888,1485,'AdCNo13552019UR','FormTypeM','2019-11-06 00:00:00.000','9:30 AM','2202','2102','Notice for Appearance/Reply','','','Hearing','Sh. Jagdish Singh Khushdil, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:33:46.000','psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:33:46.000'),(924,1889,1486,'AdCNo13562019UR','FormTypeM','2019-11-06 00:00:00.000','9:30 AM','2202','2102','Notice for Appearance/Reply','','','Hearing','Sh. Jagdish Singh Khushdil, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:35:07.000','psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:35:07.000'),(925,1890,1457,'AdCNo13352019UR','FormTypeM','2019-11-06 00:00:00.000','9:3