 . let notice be issued through email and registered speed post','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-17 08:47:51.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-17 08:47:51.000'),(1655,2575,1471,'AdCNo13822019','FormTypeM','2020-02-06 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2103','Consideration','','Written reply and the authorisation has been filed on behalf of the respondent. Copy supplied. Now to come up on 06.02.2020 for filing additional documents if any, written submissions and for consideration on the point of violation/contravention  of the provisions of the Act.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 09:01:31.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 09:01:31.000'),(1656,2576,1471,'AdCNo13822019','FormTypeM','2020-02-14 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2103','Consideration','','The case is fixed for filing written submissions by the complainant.  However, the representative for the respondent has placed on record copy of the Order passed by the Honble Supreme Court in relation to the present proceedings the representative for complainant wants to probe the matter further for addressing arguments on the point as to whether the present proceedings are covered in the purview of the said order.  Now to come up on 14.02.2020 for consideration.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 09:02:41.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 09:02:41.000'),(1657,2577,1471,'AdCNo13822019','FormTypeM','2020-03-09 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2103','Consideration','','The case has been taken up today as I had to proceed on leave on 14.02.2020. Adjournment is requested on behalf of the complainant for addressing on the question of scope of the judgement dated 20.01.2020 passed by the Honble Apex Court placed on record by the respondent. Now to come up on 09.03.2020 for consideration on the point of violation/contravention of the provisions of the Act, if any','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 09:03:36.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 09:03:36.000'),(1658,2578,1161,'AdCNo10882019','FormTypeM','2019-12-04 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2118','Notice for Reply','','Reply to the application of the respondent for setting aside the order for proceeding exparte has not been filed and rather the representative for the complainant vide his separate statement has stated no objection for the same. Heard. Considering the fact that the complainant has given no objection, taken together with the fact that the contentious questions of the right of the parties are to be adjudicated on merits rather than technicalities, the exparte order dated 30.05.2019 proceeding respondent exparte is set aside, subject however to payment of cost of Rs. 2000/- and the application of the respondent in this behalf is accordingly allowed. Now to come up on 04.12.2019 for payment of cost and filing written reply by the respondent.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 09:07:37.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 09:07:37.000'),(1659,2579,1161,'AdCNo10882019','FormTypeM','2020-01-15 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2105','Additional Evidence','','Cost of Rs. 2000/- has been tendered by the representative for the respondent and accepted by the representative for the complainant. Written reply along with annexures filed. Copy supplied.  Now to come up on 15.01.2020 for filing additional documents if any, with advance copy to the opposite party and for consideration on the point of contravention/ violation of the provisions of the act, if any.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 09:08:25.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 09:08:25.000'),(1660,2580,1161,'AdCNo10882019','FormTypeM'