e is directed that respondent shall file regular reply to the complaint taking the maintainability points as preliminary issue on the next date of hearing. The case is adjourned to 09.03.2020 for filing reply.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:20:59.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:20:59.000'),(1700,2620,1628,'AdCNo14772019','FormTypeM','2020-03-09 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2118','Notice for Reply','','The case has been taken up today as I had to proceed on leave on 14.02.2020. Respondent is duly served and has already put in appearance and has filed short reply to agitate the maintainability of the complaint rather than taking it as preliminary objections and also filing reply to the merits of the complaint. It therefore is directed that respondent shall file regular reply to the complaint taking the maintainability points as preliminary issue on the next date of hearing. The case is adjourned to 09.03.2020 for filing reply.\r\n\r\n','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:23:25.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:23:25.000'),(1701,2621,1629,'AdCNo14782019','FormTypeM','2020-03-09 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2118','Notice for Reply','','The case has been taken up today as I had to proceed on leave on 14.02.2020. Respondent is duly served and has already put in appearance and has filed short reply to agitate the maintainability of the complaint rather than taking it as preliminary objections and also filing reply to the merits of the complaint. It therefore is directed that respondent shall file regular reply to the complaint taking the maintainability points as preliminary issue on the next date of hearing. The case is adjourned to 09.03.2020 for filing reply.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:24:56.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:24:56.000'),(1702,2622,1375,'AdCNo12832019','FormTypeM','2016-12-16 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2118','Notice for Reply','','Previous cost of Rs. 1000/- tendered by the representative for the respondent and accepted by the representative for the complainant. Further representative for the respondent seeks adjournment on the ground that three separate matters of the same nature are slated and written reply is to be filed in all the said cases by taking the similar pleas being of the same project. Now to come up on 16.12.2019 for filing written reply.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:26:26.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:26:26.000'),(1703,2623,1375,'AdCNo12832019','FormTypeM','2020-01-17 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2105','Additional Evidence','','Written reply filed. Copy filed. However documents have not been furnished despite granting sufficient opportunity. Further adjournment is requested for filing documents. Allowed. Now to come up on 17.01.2020 for filing additional documents by the respondent. Subject to payment of cost of Rs. 500/-.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:27:01.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:27:01.000'),(1704,2624,1375,'AdCNo12832019','FormTypeM','2020-02-14 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2105','Additional Evidence','','	Further documents have not been filed by the respondent despite adjournment which had been granted, subject to costs. Further adjournment is requested on the ground that some more time is required for the same. In this view of the matter though adjournment is granted for 14.02.2020 in the interest of justice but the same shall be subject to payment of further costs of Rs. 1000/-','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:27:43.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-19 10:2