ication for setting aside the order dated 01.10.2019 proceeding respondent exparte. Copy supplied. The representative for the complainant however has suffered statement of no objection for allowing the application of the respondent. Heard. Considering the fact that matter is at the initial stage and moreover the complainant has given concession for allowing the application and otherwise also the rights of the parties are to be adjudicated on merits rather than technicalities. Therefore I direct that order dated 01.10.2019 proceeding respondent exparte is set aside. Subject to payment of costs of Rs. 3000/-. Now to come up on 04.02.2020 for reply/consideration on the application. ','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-25 12:14:27.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-25 12:14:27.000'),(1864,2781,1038,'AdCNo10402018','FormTypeM','2020-02-19 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2118','Notice for Reply','','','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-25 12:15:44.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-25 12:15:44.000'),(1865,2782,1038,'AdCNo10402018','FormTypeM','2020-03-12 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2105','Additional Evidence','','Written reply has been filed by the representative for the respondent. Copy supplied. Previous costs of Rs. 4000/- has been tendered by the respondent and accepted on behalf of the complainant.  Now to come up on 12.03.2020 for filing written submissions and additional documents if any by the complainant.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-25 12:16:16.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-25 12:16:16.000'),(1866,2783,1035,'AdCNo10392018','FormTypeM','2020-01-06 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2106','Arguments','','Adjournment is requested by the complainant on the ground that his counsel is not available today. Allowed. Now to come up on 06.01.2020 for argum