r\n\r\n','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 08:47:38.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 08:47:38.000'),(1942,2857,1289,'AdCNo12142019','FormTypeM','2020-02-20 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2106','Arguments','','Adjournment is requested by the proxy for the respondent on the ground that the argument counsel for the respondent is unwell.  Allowed.  Now to come up on 20.02.2020 for arguments.\r\n\r\n','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 08:50:05.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 08:50:05.000'),(1943,2858,1289,'AdCNo12142019','FormTypeM','2020-03-24 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2106','Arguments','','It is stated by the proxy representative for the respondent that father of senior counsel is not well and requested for adjournment for addressing arguments. Allowed. Now to come up on 24.03.2020 for arguments.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 08:50:34.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 08:50:34.000'),(1944,2859,1424,'AdCNo13122019','FormTypeM','2019-11-21 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2105','Additional Evidence','','Mr. Manmohan Sharma Advocate has appeared in the court and has filed Power of Attorney of Mr. Dinesh Madra Advocate representative for the respondent and states that he has the instructions of his senior counsel to appear in this case today and seek adjournment for filing the reply as his senior counsel had to go out of station. As per record the respondent was served on 18/09/2019 and the hard copy of the complaint and annexures was received by the respondent on 25th September 2019 and the reply has not filed by the respondent as per the statutory requirement for filing the same within 15 days of receipt of the notice of this authority and no plausible explanation is forthcoming. In the interest of justice adjournment is granted for filing written submissions for 21.11.2019 subject to payment of cost of Rs. 1000/-','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 08:51:46.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 08:51:46.000'),(1945,2860,1424,'AdCNo13122019','FormTypeM','2020-01-06 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2105','Additional Evidence','','','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 08:52:15.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 08:52:15.000'),(1946,2861,1424,'AdCNo13122019','FormTypeM','2020-01-24 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2105','Additional Evidence','','Written reply filed. Copy supplied. Now to come up on 24.01.2020 for written submissions by the complainant and for consideration on the point of contravention/violation of the provisions of the Act, if any. The costs imposed shall be paid on the next date of hearing.\r\n\r\n','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 09:03:16.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 09:03:16.000'),(1947,2862,1424,'AdCNo13122019','FormTypeM','2020-02-20 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2106','Arguments','','The written submissions have been filed by representative for the complainant.  Copy supplied and it is stated that no further document is to be filed. Now to come up on 20.02.2020 for arguments. The cost already imposed shall positively paid by the respondent on the next date of hearing.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 09:03:54.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 09:03:54.000'),(1948,2863,1424,'AdCNo13122019','FormTypeM','2020-04-07 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2106','Arguments','','It is stated by the proxy representative that Sh. Chaman Lal Goyal Advocate representative for the complainant has suffered with heart problem and is not in a position to address arguments. Now to come up on 07.04.2020 for addressing arguments.  Previous costs imposed shall be paid on the next date of hearing by the respondent','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 09:04:26.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 09:04:26.000'),(1949,2864,1382,'AdCNo12872019','FormTypeM','2020-03-09 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2203','2103','Consideration','',' From the averments in the complaint, it transpires that the complainant does not want to opt out of the project and rather wants to remain in the project and seeks direction for implementing the terms and conditions of the agreement between the parties and also seeks interest because of the delay in delivery  the possession of the property. In view of the ratio of the Appellate Authority in the case titled Sandeep Mann V/s Real Estate Regulatory Authority & Ors, it is apparent that the relief claimed by the complainant in the present complaint can only be granted by the Authority under RERA and not by the Adjudicating Officer. Therefore the complaint is transferred to the Authority for decision. The complaint be put up before Learned Chairperson RERA on 09.03.2020. The complaint is directed to appear before the said bench on the date fixed. ','Hearing','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','15','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 12:56:36.000','executiveassistantao','2020-02-26 12:56:36.000'),(1950,2865,1568,'AdCNo14242019UR','FormTypeM','2020-01-02 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2105','Additional Evidence','','Respondent has been duly served through E-mail on 05.12.2019 and through Registered Speed Post on 10.12.2019. There was sufficient time with the respondent to put in appearance. However neither the respondent nor any of its representative in its behalf has turned up and the case has been called repeatedly since morning. It is 04 00 pm now and the cause list is also exhausted. Therefore respondent is proceeded against exparte. Now to come up on 