n if the order proceeding respondent exparte set aside. In view of the concession given by the complainant taken together with the fact that case was ripe for exparte arguments, I direct that order proceeding respondent exparte dated 18.03.2019 is set aside,subject, however, to payment of costs of Rs. 5000/- and the application filed in this behalf by the respondent is allowed. Now to come up on 08.01.2020 for payment of costs and filing written reply.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-03-05 07:54:09.000','executiveassistantao','2020-03-05 07:54:09.000'),(2158,3072,1106,'AdCNo10602019','FormTypeM','2020-02-10 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2105','Additional Evidence','','Written reply filed. Copy supplied. Now to come up on 10.02.2020 for filing additional documents, written submissions and payment of previous cost of Rs. 5000/-.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-03-05 07:54:49.000','executiveassistantao','2020-03-05 07:54:49.000'),(2159,3073,1106,'AdCNo10602019','FormTypeM','2020-02-27 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2106','Arguments','','It is stated on behalf of the complainant that no further additional document is to filed nor any written submission is to filed.  Now to come up on 27.02.2020 for final arguments.  The costs already imposed shall be paid on next date of hearing by the respondent.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-03-05 07:55:24.000','executiveassistantao','2020-03-05 07:55:24.000'),(2160,3074,1106,'AdCNo10602019','FormTypeM','2020-04-16 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2106','Arguments','','Adjournment is requested on behalf of the complainant for addressing arguments.  Now to come up on 16.04.2020 for addressing arguments.  Previous costs of Rs.5000/- have been tendered and accepted. ','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0