lf of the complainant through office that he could not appear in the Court as he is in Rajasthan.  Now to come up on 28.07.2020 for the preliminary hearing.','Preliminary Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:21:57.000','executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:21:57.000'),(3636,4514,1775,'AdCNo15902020UR','FormTypeM','2020-06-30 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2101','Preliminary Hearing','','Representative for the complainant in response to the notice has turned up today, but seeks adjournment to comply with the deficiencies in filing of the complaint. In this view of the matter the online complaint be returned to the complainant for filing the same on or before 30.06.2020 after rectification of the defects. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:23:04.000','executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:23:04.000'),(3637,4515,1820,'AdCNo16182020','FormTypeM','2020-07-13 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2118','Notice for Reply','','Respondent served and has put in appearance through its representative who has filed authorisation. However, adjournment is requested on behalf of the respondent to file written reply that due to non-receipt of the notice with the copy of the complaint, the respondent was unable to prepare the reply. Copy of the complaint has been supplied to the representative for the respondent today in the Court.  Now to come up on 13.07.2020 for filing written reply.  However, none has appeared on behalf of the complainant. In the interest of justice and due to the prevailing circumstances and nationwide lockdown, intimation be sent to the complainant about the next date of hearing and the purpose for which it has been fixed through any mode of communication.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:24:11.000','executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:24:11.000'),(3638,4516,1425,'AdCNo13142019','FormTypeM','2020-07-07 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2118','Notice for Reply','','The case was fixed for filing reply, however, none has appeared on behalf of the respondent. In the interest of justice and due to the prevailing circumstances and nationwide lockdown, the case is adjourned to 07.07.2020 for filing reply.  Intimation be sent to the respondent about the next date of hearing and the purpose for which it has been fixed through any mode of communication.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:25:09.000','executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:25:09.000'),(3639,4517,1429,'AdCNo13202019','FormTypeM','2020-07-07 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2105','Additional Evidence','','An application was filed on behalf of the respondent for calling upon the complainant to place on record the document regarding bank account statements, but, notice of the said application could not be issued to the complainant due to prevailing circumstances and outbreak of COVID 19. Notice to the complainant be issued for 07.07.2020 for filing reply to the application and for written submissions. ','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:27:32.000','executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:27:32.000'),(3640,4518,1291,'AdCNo12192019','FormTypeM','2020-06-29 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2106','Arguments','','Arguments heard in part.  Now to come up on 29.06.2020 for remaining arguments and further proceedings.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:30:13.000','executiveassistantao','2020-06-22 14:30:13.000'),(3641,4519,1564,'AdCNo14172019','FormTypeM','2020-07-29 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2106','Arguments','','The case was fixed for arguments, but none has appeared, however, in the interest 