20.  Respondent shall have to file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least 3 days prior to the date fixed.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2020-06-22 15:40:28.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2020-06-22 15:40:28.000'),(3644,4521,1864,'AdCNo16362020','FormTypeM','2020-07-31 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2102','Notice for Appearance/Reply','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondent through E-mail/ Registered Speed Post for 31.07.2020.  Respondent shall have to file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least 3 days.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-06-23 14:44:44.000','executiveassistantao','2020-06-23 14:44:44.000'),(3645,4522,1812,'AdCNo16122020','FormTypeM','2020-07-30 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2102','Notice for Appearance/Reply','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondent through E-mail/ Registered Speed Post for 30.07.2020.  Respondent shall have to file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least 3 days.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-06-23 14:45:55.000','executiveassistantao','2020-06-23 14:45:55.000'),(3646,4523,1755,'AdCNo15912020','FormTypeM','2020-07-30 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','2206','2102','Notice for Appearance/Reply','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondent through E-mail/ Registered Speed Post for 30.07.2020.  Respondent shall have to file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least 3 days.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','15','','',3,1,0,0,'ex